WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.780
Do you ever have important
stuff deep within a Basecamp

2
00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:04.621
project, but you'd like to bring it front

3
00:00:04.621 --> 00:00:07.141
and center so everyone
has easy access to it

4
00:00:07.141 --> 00:00:08.661
and nothing gets lost.

5
00:00:08.661 --> 00:00:11.422
Maybe it's an important
meeting on the calendar

6
00:00:11.422 --> 00:00:13.663
or a kickoff message on the message board.

7
00:00:13.663 --> 00:00:16.283
No matter what it is, you
can now surface those things

8
00:00:16.283 --> 00:00:18.424
with a feature we call Spotlights.

9
00:00:18.424 --> 00:00:21.184
Let me show you how it
works. So on my project,

10
00:00:21.184 --> 00:00:24.905
I have a message board post
that I've called "Important."

11
00:00:24.905 --> 00:00:27.466
Now I can go to this three-dot menu

12
00:00:27.466 --> 00:00:30.406
and click "Spotlight on project page."

13
00:00:30.406 --> 00:00:31.707
When I go back, you'll see

14
00:00:31.707 --> 00:00:34.287
that item right here at the
top in a separate section.

15
00:00:34.287 --> 00:00:35.908
It's now just one click

16
00:00:35.908 --> 00:00:38.048
for anyone on that project to get to.

17
00:00:38.048 --> 00:00:40.549
You can spotlight just about
anything within a project.

18
00:00:40.549 --> 00:00:41.789
So let's go ahead

19
00:00:41.789 --> 00:00:44.890
and spotlight this team
call that's coming up.

20
00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:47.770
You can also spotlight documents, folders.

21
00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:49.151
We'll add this folder here,

22
00:00:50.251 --> 00:00:52.171
just spotlight on the project page.

23
00:00:52.171 --> 00:00:53.572
And when I go back, all

24
00:00:53.572 --> 00:00:55.712
of those links are right there at the top.

25
00:00:55.712 --> 00:00:58.853
You can drag them around to
any order that you would like.

26
00:00:58.853 --> 00:01:00.593
And when you have an upcoming call

27
00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:03.074
or meeting, you'll see
the countdown 15 minutes

28
00:01:03.074 --> 00:01:05.355
before along with the join link.

29
00:01:05.355 --> 00:01:08.395
Now that important stuff is
easy for people to get to,

30
00:01:08.395 --> 00:01:09.228
no more digging.
